  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hello there, youngster! Are you familiar with the\nPokémon called Budew?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dedew!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500640065007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Budew is a hardy little thing. It endures the cold\nbravely, waiting for the right time to open its bud.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I sense great potential in you, youngster. You\nmight have a knack for helping Budew to bloom.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMaybe you could join our Budew show?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re interested, head to the fountain square\nin Bleu Sector 8. I hope to see you there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "One must always keep their Budew in excellent\nhealth. For me, that’s the most important thing!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When I judge Budew, I look for the artistry in\ntheir expressions and movements.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hello there, youngster. I hoped you would join us.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006C006C006F002000740068006500720065002C00200079006F0075006E00670073007400650072002E0020004900200068006F00700065006400200079006F007500200077006F0075006C00640020006A006F0069006E002000750073002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But what’s this? You didn’t bring a Budew...?\nWell, come back when you have one with you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And you brought a Budew, too. Splendid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200079006F0075002000620072006F007500670068007400200061002000420075006400650077002C00200074006F006F002E002000530070006C0065006E006400690064002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Your name is...<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, is it? A\nname<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbudding<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwith<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npotential.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now, then. To enter the competition, you’ll need\nto pay a participation fee of <U+E300>5,800.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here you go!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650072006500200079006F007500200067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have to pay?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006800610076006500200074006F0020007000610079003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I understand your concern, but I promise, you and\nyour Budew will have nothing to worry about.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, dear. You may need to secure more funds...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200064006500610072002E00200059006F00750020006D006100790020006E00650065006400200074006F00200073006500630075007200650020006D006F00720065002000660075006E00640073002E002E002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wonderful! Let’s get started, shall we?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F006E00640065007200660075006C00210020004C0065007420190073002000670065007400200073007400610072007400650064002C0020007300680061006C006C002000770065003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad to see you...but where is your Budew?\nDo come back when you have one in your party.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our first entry is...Florèle’s Budew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075007200200066006900720073007400200065006E007400720079002000690073002E002E002E0046006C006F007200E8006C006520190073002000420075006400650077002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "B-bu.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042002D00620075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ooh, the luster on this one’s bud really gives new\nmeaning to the word lustrous! Quite superb.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, but its body language isn’t sparking anything\nin me. In that sense, it fails to impress...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Judging from its cry, the poor dear may well be\nsuffering from stage fright.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s move on to entry number two... Balsam’s\nBudew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074201900730020006D006F007600650020006F006E00200074006F00200065006E0074007200790020006E0075006D006200650072002000740077006F002E002E002E002000420061006C00730061006D20190073000A00420075006400650077002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Budi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750064006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh yes, lovely. Its posture exudes dignity and\nstrength in spades. Very nice indeed.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Its cry is...passable, I suppose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400730020006300720079002000690073002E002E002E007000610073007300610062006C0065002C0020004900200073007500700070006F00730065002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hrm... The lack of color in its complexion is hardly\nideal, though. This Budew needs more sunlight.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moving on—here’s entry number three...\nMarigold’s Budew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F00760069006E00670020006F006E201400680065007200652019007300200065006E0074007200790020006E0075006D006200650072002000740068007200650065002E002E002E000A004D0061007200690067006F006C006420190073002000420075006400650077002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bubu!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006200750021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, look at that! What a large specimen! It\ncertainly won’t be lacking in pollen.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The self-assured manner in which it sways from\nside to side is simply iconic. An inspiration!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, but I detect a hint of irritation in its cry...\nI suspect this Budew might be a little stressed.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Last but not least, let’s look at entry number four:\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>’s Budew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610073007400200062007500740020006E006F00740020006C0065006100730074002C0020006C00650074201900730020006C006F006F006B00200061007400200065006E0074007200790020006E0075006D00620065007200200066006F00750072003A000A001000020100000020190073002000420075006400650077002100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Budeeew!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750064006500650065007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh my!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006D0079002100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Remarkable!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006D00610072006B00610062006C0065002100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impressive...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006D00700072006500730073006900760065002E002E002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just look at the luster on it—the shine! And, oh,\nits bud is so very lush. Sturdy, too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Its nimble little feet are dancing straight into my\nheart! And what a delightfully charming smile!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I agree. And it’s not just the outward excellence\nof this Budew that should be praised...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It clearly trusts its Trainer fully and without\nreservation. How else could it achieve such a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncommanding presence?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve judged innumerable Budew over the years,\nbut never have I seen one quite like this!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chairman... I think this Budew is the one.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100690072006D0061006E002E002E002E002000490020007400680069006E006B0020007400680069007300200042007500640065007700200069007300200074006800650020006F006E0065002E00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes. It seems we’re all in accord.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002E0020004900740020007300650065006D007300200077006520190072006500200061006C006C00200069006E0020006100630063006F00720064002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for showing us your wonderful Budew.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F0072002000730068006F00770069006E006700200075007300200079006F0075007200200077006F006E00640065007200660075006C002000420075006400650077002E00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Would you mind telling us how you two first\ncrossed paths?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006D0069006E0064002000740065006C006C0069006E006700200075007300200068006F007700200079006F0075002000740077006F002000660069007200730074000A00630072006F0073007300650064002000700061007400680073003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It was a random encounter",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074002000770061007300200061002000720061006E0064006F006D00200065006E0063006F0075006E0074006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fate brought us together",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006100740065002000620072006F007500670068007400200075007300200074006F0067006500740068006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And how have you been training your Budew?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200068006F00770020006800610076006500200079006F00750020006200650065006E00200074007200610069006E0069006E006700200079006F00750072002000420075006400650077003F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
