      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006D0061006B0065002000730075007200650020006900740020006700650074007300200070006C0065006E007400790020006F0066002000720065007300740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
